  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/57/logo.png\" width=\"825\" height=\"464\">\n</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>關於</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">一款具有日本特色的模組，以下是主要特色：<strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J7xjqQXp/japaneseculture-barriers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"45\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>日本紫藤 (藤)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">全新的生物群系「日本紫藤公園」，懸崖上生長著巨大的日本紫藤樹</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/59/2023-09-07_17.png\" width=\"826\" height=\"405\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>狸（たぬき）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">一種全新的動物生物，就是狸！（或稱貉），一種棲息於森林、櫻花林和日本紫藤公園的生物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/61/2023-09-07_17.png\" width=\"826\" height=\"405\">\n  \n鬼（Oni）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">源自日本神話的怪物，共有四種變體。目前尚未開放生成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/90/2023-09-07_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"405\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J7xjqQXp/japaneseculture-barriers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"45\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>",
